sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant C as critic subagent
    U->>O: "critique this sentence"
    O->>O: match request to the subagent's description
    O->>C: task(subagent_type="critic", description="...")
    Note over C: fresh context — nothing from the orchestrator's history
    C->>C: reason, draft, revise
    C-->>O: three bullet points (only this crosses back)
    O-->>U: one-sentence summary
